    "turn_text": "right? Absolutely. And that's what they've done time and time again now and we discover it. They are not willing to lie. They are motivated or animated to lie if it advances the cause. So they are no longer observers. Like I said, they are players. And we're not going to surface. They're not going to surface. Their view is that they wouldn't think of surfacing something that was critical of the woke left. So they just bury it. which is what they did with Hunter Biden's computer. It's what they've done with thousands of different things where it's inconvenient and so they don't want to tell it and they don't. So you can no longer think you said it well and you said, you know, if you think they are reporting the truth, you are deceiving yourself.",
